{
  "summary": "The experiment tested the scgpt RNA encoder in a multiprofile RNA-only setup, comparing it to scvi_n200 (config_005) with avgpool aggregation. Validation accuracy (0.5305) and F1 (0.5152) are lower than config_005's 0.6501 and 0.6275, suggesting scgpt may underperform. However, the exact impact of the encoder choice versus other factors remains uncertain without further comparative analysis."
}

